From 4586209ac38b91b32779120225a481fddaa825bd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <bot@local>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 18:37:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Rewrite API layer to query Supabase Postgres instead of
 MongoDB/Mongoose

- models/* now export plain pg repos (findAll/findById/create/updateById/deleteById)
  instead of Mongoose Model classes
- handlerFactory.js generic CRUD rewritten against the repo pattern
- authController.js: bcrypt + JWT against the users table directly (session/password
  logic unchanged, just no more Mongoose document methods)
- errorController.js: added translations for Postgres error codes (23505 unique,
  23502 not-null, 23503 foreign key, 22P02 invalid input) alongside the old Mongo ones
- avg_rating on services is now kept in sync by the DB trigger from the earlier
  migration, not an app-side post-save hook
- server.js: dropped the leftover top-level mongoose require
- removed featureModel.js (features are now a jsonb column on services)
